   "Wander the Boboli Gardens behind Palazzo Pitti, past fountains, statues and Buontalenti's grotto.",
   "See Michelangelo's David up close in the Galleria dell'Accademia.",
   "Roll fresh pasta with a Florentine cook in a private class, then sit down to eat it with local wine.",
   "Browse the Oltrarno's artisan workshops, where Florentine crafts are still made by hand.",
   "Spend a day in Chianti, tasting Chianti Classico at estates around Greve and hilltop Montefioralle.",
   "Watch the sun set over the Duomo and the Arno from Piazzale Michelangelo."
