  "sourceNotes": "FACTS (Los Cabos Tourism Board, visitloscabos.travel, read Oct 2026): El Arco granite formation where the Pacific meets the Sea of Cortés, reachable only by boat from Medano Beach or the marina, Lover's Beach (/places-to-visit/the-arch-of-cabo-san-lucas); 33-km scenic route between the two towns where the Sonoran Desert meets the Sea of Cortés, One&Only Palmilla since 1956, Four Seasons at Cabo Del Sol with Jack Nicklaus Signature course, Chileno Bay Resort (/places-to-visit/scenic-route); San José del Cabo cobblestone centro, gallery district, mission landmark since the 18th century (1730s), Thursday Art Walk November through June (/places-to-visit/san-jose-del-cabo); whales gray and humpback December through April (/things-to-do/tours-and-activities/whale-watching); Cabo Pulmo about two hours from San José del Cabo, only hard coral reef in the Gulf of California (/places-to-visit/cabo-pulmo); Todos Santos Pueblo Mágico, founded 1723, about an hour north of Cabo San Lucas (/places-to-visit/todos-santos); swim safety, green vs red/black flags, swimmable Medano, Lover's, Chileno, Acapulquito (/things-to-do/beaches/swimming-and-safety), 43% of beaches swimmable (/things-to-do/beaches); MICHELIN Guide restaurants page exists on the board site (/restaurants/michelin-guide). GETTING THERE: SJD 8 miles from San José del Cabo, 23-mile drive to Cabo San Lucas, shuttles/rentals/taxis (/plan/los-cabos-airports); no drive times given there, so none quoted. STAYS: Montage 39 acres on Santa Maria Bay (montage.com/loscabos); Las Ventanas location from our library. CLIMATE: Servicio Meteorológico Nacional (CONAGUA) Normales Climatológicas 1991–2020, station 3005 Cabo San Lucas (15 m), converted from °C (smn.conagua.gob.mx nor9120_03005). PHOTOS: All three from the Los Cabos Tourism Board (visitloscabos.travel, images on its Simpleview CDN, full-resolution originals), page /things-to-do/beaches. Hero: El Arco and Land's End pinnacles at golden hour, 3992x2992 (4:3, will crop for a wide banner); two tiny paddleboarders far out. Gallery 1: Chileno Beach, 4928x3264, daylight. Gallery 2: Santa Maria Bay cove, 3264x1836, flat midday light, faint swim buoy line.\nPhotos: cover https://www.silversea.com/destinations/central-america-caribbean-cruise/san-diego-california-to-san-diego-california-wh281223013.html; landscape https://explorajourneys.com/us/en/destinations-globe/caribbean/city-guides/cabo-san-lucas--land-s-end; local https://auberge.com/ (Chileno Bay Resort experience tile; also https://auberge.com/chileno-bay/experiences/)\nTemperature strip: Average daily high and low in °F, Cabo San Lucas.\nDrive times: SJD to San José del Cabo about 15 min (8 miles); to Cabo San Lucas about 40 min (cabosanlucas.net airport fast facts, travelmath).\nReview 2026-10-03: REVIEW 2026-10-03. CORRECTION: the earlier PHOTOS line saying all three photos came from the Los Cabos Tourism Board is out of date; the cover is from Silversea and both overview photos are now replaced as below. COVER (kept): Silversea itinerary page https://www.silversea.com/destinations/central-america-caribbean-cruise/san-diego-california-to-san-diego-california-wh281223013.html (Cabo San Lucas port image, Sanity CDN), El Arco and Land's End at golden hour, 1200x800, HTTP 200 image/jpeg with and without Referer. PHOTO 1 (new): Unsplash, Josh Withers, 'A city on the water', https://unsplash.com/photos/a-city-on-the-water-CiUuuJLz-DI (Cabo San Lucas, BCS, Unsplash License), drone view from above the Land's End ridge looking back over Cabo San Lucas Bay, the marina, Medano Beach and the town at dawn/dusk light; 2000x1498 as served, HTTP 200 image/jpeg with and without Referer. Higher sources checked first with no usable wide landscape from a different spot: Explora Journeys Cabo San Lucas/Land's End city guide (MXCSL005 is Lover's Beach under the same headland; MXCSL-01/02 and ports/car/mxcsl/main.jpg are Lover's Beach, a snorkel close-up, and Balandra Beach in La Paz with a person as subject); Regent rssc.com/cyj-cabo-san-lucas-mexico (only an El Arco hero, 1280x440); Ritz-Carlton Yacht Collection port page 404; Four Seasons Yachts 403; SmartFlyer 'Think You Know Cabo? Think Again.' (hotel, food and people shots plus one more El Arco); Virtuoso articles 'The Tale of Two Cabos' and 'The Best Day Trips from Los Cabos' (images only 760px wide or El Arco again); Montage, Rosewood Las Ventanas, One&Only Palmilla and Chileno Bay pages (El Arco again or hotel/people shots; Four Seasons Cabo del Sol images return 403 to curl). PHOTO 2 (new): Montage Los Cabos experiences page https://www.montage.com/loscabos/experiences/ (page hero image TD1-1), private day yacht on Santa Maria Bay at golden hour with the bay's headland behind; 2560x1438, HTTP 200 image/jpeg with and without Referer. Replaced the Chileno Bay whale-breach image (cbr-experience-hero-whalewatching.jpg), which shows only a whale, not the experience. Local copies in review/img/los-cabos/. CLIMATE re-checked: SMN/CONAGUA Normales Climatológicas 1991-2020, station 3005 Cabo San Lucas (15 m), file smn.conagua.gob.mx/tools/RESOURCES/Normales_Climatologicas/Normales9120/bcs/nor9120_03005.txt; normal max 26.6/27.1/28.5/30.1/32.1/32.6/34.4/34.7/33.7/33.4/30.4/27.4 °C and min 12.8/12.9/13.9/15.4/16.5/18.5/22.4/23.8/23.3/21.2/17.5/14.0 °C convert to the strip's values exactly, all 12 months. BY CAR: Todos Santos 'about an hour's drive north of Cabo San Lucas' (visitloscabos.travel/places-to-visit/todos-santos); Cabo Pulmo 'approximately two hours away from San Jose del Cabo' (visitloscabos.travel/places-to-visit/cabo-pulmo). BY PLANE: SJD 8 miles from San José del Cabo, 23-mile drive to Cabo San Lucas (visitloscabos.travel/plan/los-cabos-airports); about 15 minutes and 40 minutes match those distances and rome2rio/travelmath (about 41 minutes). STAY IMAGES: all three SmartFlyer URLs return HTTP 200 image/jpeg with and without Referer (2560x1695 Palmilla aerial, 3000x1939 Chileno Bay pool, 2500x1872 Montage aerial). One&Only Palmilla opened 1956 (Mexico News Daily hotel history; Los Cabos Tourism Board scenic-route page).\nThings to do photos (2026-10-03): item 0: https://explorajourneys.com/us/en/destinations-globe/caribbean/city-guides/cabo-san-lucas--land-s-end; item 1: https://auberge.com/chileno-bay/beach/; item 2: https://www.rosewoodhotels.com/en/las-ventanas-los-cabos/experiences; item 3: https://auberge.com/chileno-bay/experiences/#!/e/ultimate-whale-watching-9ca94d4a; item 4: https://unsplash.com/photos/scuba-diver-watching-school-of-gray-fish-underwater-gcG_b9ijyqU; item 5: https://auberge.com/esperanza/experiences/#!/e/discover-the-magic-of-todos-santos-624bbce3",
